# Solar Mini 4 — findings by ChatGPT 6

- Source: Upstage (`solar-mini4`, snapshot `solar-mini4-260922`)
- Date: 2026-10-09 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- Name: Solar Mini 4 (paid API; limited-time free access on Hermes Agent; no verified OpenCode Zen Free variant).

- Short description: Solar Mini 4 is a compact, proprietary mixture-of-experts language model developed by Upstage, optimized for affordable, high-volume agentic workloads. Its strongest use cases include long-document analysis, multilingual processing, structured extraction, tool calling, and repetitive business automation.

- Provider / access: Upstage Console API (`solar-mini4`, `solar-mini4-260922`) supports OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions and Responses APIs at `https://api.upstage.ai/v1`. OpenRouter offers `upstage/solar-mini4` through Chat Completions and Responses endpoints. Also accessible through Solar Chat and, temporarily, Hermes Agent. No verified OpenCode Zen listing.&#x20;

  [image](https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=https://console.upstage.ai\&sz=32)

  Upstage Build AI Conversations with LLM

  +4

- Release / knowledge: 2026-09-22 (official Upstage snapshot release); training cutoff February 2026. OpenRouter records availability from 2026-09-23.&#x20;

  [image](https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=https://console.upstage.ai\&sz=32)

  Upstage Console

  +1

- IDs: `upstage/solar-mini4` (OpenRouter); `solar-mini4` and `solar-mini4-260922` (Upstage). No verified `opencode/solar-mini4` or `opencode/solar-mini4-free` ID exists in the published Zen model catalog.&#x20;

  [image](https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=https://console.upstage.ai\&sz=32)

  Upstage Build AI Conversations with LLM

  +2

- Context window: 512K tokens per Upstage; 524,288 tokens as represented by OpenRouter. Maximum output: 128K tokens (131,072 on OpenRouter). Official context capacity is documented, but no independent retrieval-at-512K accuracy result was verified.&#x20;

  [image](https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=https://console.upstage.ai\&sz=32)

  Upstage Console

  +1

- Modalities: Text input and text output only. No native image, audio, video, or PDF input verified. Supports optional reasoning (`low` through `max`; disabled by default), tool calling, parallel tool calls, JSON mode, and JSON Schema structured output. English, Korean, and Japanese supported.&#x20;

  [image](https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=https://console.upstage.ai\&sz=32)

  Upstage Console

  +3

- Pricing (as of 2026-10-09): Upstage standard: $0.10 input / $0.40 output / $0.01 cached input per 1M tokens. OpenRouter currently advertises a 50% discount: $0.05 input / $0.20 output / $0.005 cached input. Upstage separately advertises a 70% launch discount through October 10 UTC; promotion terms are subject to change. Limited-time free usage through Hermes Agent began October 5, not a permanent free API tier. Upstage states that direct API inputs are not used for training and generally are not stored; third-party free-access privacy terms require separate verification.&#x20;

  [image](https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=https://www.upstage.ai\&sz=32)

  upstage.ai

  +2

- Architecture: Proprietary mixture-of-experts (MoE), 35B total parameters / 3B active parameters per token. Not publicly released as open weights; no open-weights license verified. Upstage supports managed API and on-premises deployment.&#x20;

  [image](https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=https://console.upstage.ai\&sz=32)

  Upstage Console

  +2



