Long context:

\- AA-LCR: 83.3% (Artificial Analysis long-context reasoning benchmark). Upstage verifies a 512K-token supported context, but the published aggregate score does not establish retrieval accuracy specifically at 512K tokens. No verified MRCR or RULER retrieval score at 512K found.&#x20;

